  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「いやぁ、たいへん有意義な一日だったアル～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「八雲ちゃんは、さすが先輩アルね！　否、さすが演劇部というべきか……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ワタシも含めて全員に、演技指導してくれたアルっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「おかげで、『正しい接客』ができた気がするアルよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「『いらっしゃいませ、お客様！』『お客様は何名様ですか？』『ご注文は以上ですか？』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「『またのお越しをお待ちしております！』」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「……ウフフ、ちゃんと覚えたアル！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「台詞だけでなく、姿勢から腕の角度からぜんぶ指導してくれたアル！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「どうどう転校生、ワタシもちょっとは見られるものになったんじゃないアルか～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「八雲ちゃんは元気よくお客さんも呼びこんでくれたうえ、皿洗いから何からやってくれたアル！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ほんと、助かっちゃったアルよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「八雲ちゃんは、優しいひとアル～。ていうか親切アルよね！　ちょっと変なひとだけど……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「陸上部のひとたちも、八雲ちゃんの指導をうけてたアルからね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「最終的に、すっごい戦力になってくれたアル！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「やっぱり陸上部は体力あるね～、ふたりとも物覚えがよかったし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「あっという間に、完璧な『飲食店の店員』らしい振る舞いを習得してたアル～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「できれば、ずっとうちのお店で働いてほしいぐらいアル。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「でもそれじゃあ、ワタシの仕事がなくなっちゃうアルね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「みんなに、あとでちゃんとお礼しなきゃいけないアルね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「みんなのおかげで、過去最高の売り上げ＆大賑わいだったアル～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「『恋恋飯店』がこんなに大盛況だったのは、前代未聞アルよ～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
